OL,3,GNEWSATeenage motorcyclist dies after
OL,4,Ahead-on crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage motorcyclist involved in a
OL,7,Fhead-on crash with another bike has
OL,8,Fdied.
OL,10,FA Blue Yamaha MT-03 motorcycle and a
OL,11,Fblack BMW S1000 collided on Stanham
OL,12,FWay, near Cardea, Peterborough, at
OL,13,Fabout 17:20 BST on Monday.
OL,15,FThe rider of the Yamaha, a 19-year-old
OL,16,Fman from Peterborough, died in
OL,17,FPeterborough City Hospital on Tuesday,
OL,18,Fpolice said.
OL,20,FThe rider of the BMW, a 32-year-old man
OL,21,Ffrom London, sustained serious but not
OL,22,Flife-threatening injuries.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
